  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">해리된 양파뿌리를 구매하여<br>아이들데리고 실험한 결과인데<br>핵조차 안보이는 친구들이 대다수에요<br>체세포분열은 당연히 안보였구요<br>염색시간 나름 5-10분 뒀는데<br>염색이 안된걸까요?<br>세포가 아닌걸까요?<br>실험이 잘못된걸까요?<br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4b4f53dded89530fefed3019a1bedf82b4bfdc15\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4b4f53dded89530fefed3019a1bedf82b4bfdc15\" data-origin-width=\"3000\" data-origin-height=\"4000\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8825cde0fbf4760a253ae22d184fcbebb6b0a367\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8825cde0fbf4760a253ae22d184fcbebb6b0a367\" data-origin-width=\"3000\" data-origin-height=\"4000\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/214f96b1cf0be7de219008ee5d65a11c4aa2d4b1\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/214f96b1cf0be7de219008ee5d65a11c4aa2d4b1\" data-origin-width=\"3000\" data-origin-height=\"4000\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8c6558fd598f1928a74d4325fc78af764a87ba7c\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8c6558fd598f1928a74d4325fc78af764a87ba7c\" data-origin-width=\"3000\" data-origin-height=\"4000\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/53b090cd304af4761e79068493209a8a05a92508\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https:/